x}}>0\\,⟹\\,2x+2>0\\,⟹\\,x>-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the domain of $f(x)={log}_{2}⁡(\\frac{2x+2}{3+{2}^{x}})$ is $(-1,\\infty ),$ and it is also continuous on this interval."}]}
